{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53495","headline":"范忠韩喜得刘先生诗 · 刘叉","name":"范忠韩喜得刘先生诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉尺沈埋久，得之铭篆深。\n指磨露正色，扣击吐哀音。\n（《後村诗话续集》卷二引《刘叉集》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘叉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53495.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53495","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}